Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, python3-xlib, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Description: Simple sticky notes for the Linux desktop
 Nota is a GTK4/libadwaita sticky-notes app with a tray icon, inspired by
 xpad. Supports rich text formatting, nested bullet and checkbox lists,
 note groups, a recoverable trash, and note backup/export.
